WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.400
Deviation Lens. See the image. Choose the file.

00:03.500 --> 00:09.000
Find every version. Scan the page you’re on for available images.

00:09.100 --> 00:13.200
Compare every version. Size, format, and quality, with the best one marked.

00:13.300 --> 00:19.800
One ZIP, not a pile of files. Save your picks together, with credit for every artist.

00:19.900 --> 00:22.200
