00:22.300 --> 00:24.600
Set it up your way. Filters, file names, and history, on one settings page.

00:25.000 --> 00:27.800
Deviation Lens. Free on the Chrome Web Store. Independent project. Not affiliated with or endorsed by DeviantArt.
